{"about_the_game":"<u>Blossoming Ruins</u> is a <strong>cozy idle city-builder</strong> and <strong>colony simulator</strong> designed to quietly grow at the bottom of your screen while you go about your day, rebuilding a kingdom from the ruins of war.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebuild your kingdom:</strong></h2>Restore structures, reclaim land, and bring life back to your war-torn realm. Watch as your kingdom evolves from crumbled ruins into a vibrant haven, step by step. Unlock new buildings and upgrades as you progress, from quaint cottages to grand halls, ensuring your kingdom thrives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/fd8ad78b540a859aab7fb106efc945f0.poster.avif?t=1744993045\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/fd8ad78b540a859aab7fb106efc945f0.webm?t=1744993045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/fd8ad78b540a859aab7fb106efc945f0.mp4?t=1744993045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Villager activities:</strong></h2>Recruit villagers to handle tasks such as gathering resources, constructing buildings, and tending to the land. As they perform these duties, their skills will naturally improve, ensuring your kingdom runs smoothly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/1c7608954ba48be6d90ff51204a25f99.poster.avif?t=1744993045\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/1c7608954ba48be6d90ff51204a25f99.webm?t=1744993045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/1c7608954ba48be6d90ff51204a25f99.mp4?t=1744993045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automate with magic:</strong></h2>Utilize various magical tools to automate your kingdom further, from placing portals that connect resources to your base, to employing magical creatures that assist your villagers and streamline tasks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/bd2042168c5b7380a1a514b798d59197.poster.avif?t=1744993045\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/bd2042168c5b7380a1a514b798d59197.webm?t=1744993045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/bd2042168c5b7380a1a514b798d59197.mp4?t=1744993045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize and decorate:</strong></h2>Personalize your kingdom by adjusting the appearance of buildings, villagers, and the environment. Add extra elements like flowers and pets that roam your land. Tailor every detail to make it truly your own.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/cbe4b490bbfb2f7d6b2e0470549a6d2f.poster.avif?t=1744993045\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/cbe4b490bbfb2f7d6b2e0470549a6d2f.apng?t=1744993045\" class=\"bb_img\" width=284 height=192 /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/f952e828611b6b7200d091e75639f7d7.poster.avif?t=1744993045\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/f952e828611b6b7200d091e75639f7d7.apng?t=1744993045\" class=\"bb_img\" width=284 height=192 /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multitasking and accessibility:</strong></h2>Blossoming Ruins seamlessly integrates into your daily life by resting at the bottom of your screen, letting you tend to other activities while your kingdom develops. Adjust the view by zooming, or switch to vertical to meet your needs. The game naturally works for all screen sizes, the wider the screen the more of your kingdom can potentially see at once!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/extras/741d1fc1956b4476216dbfd9bb26e040.avif?t=1744993045\" width=600 height=252 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2981060?t=1744993045","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2981060?t=1744993045","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/af4c612c1c541d444c1992de8361dd9675064fe0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744993045","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981060/af4c612c1c541d444c1992de8361dd9675064fe0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744993045","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<u>Blossoming Ruins</u> is a <strong>cozy idle city-builder</strong> and <strong>colony simulator</strong> designed to quietly grow at the bottom of your screen while you go about your day, rebuilding a kingdom from the ruins of war.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebuild your kingdom:</strong></h2>Restore structures, reclaim land, and bring life back to